# VS Code extension: REST Client
# Replace placeholders locally; never commit OAuth tokens.
@instance = https://YOUR_DOMAIN.my.salesforce.com
@token = REPLACE_WITH_OAUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@runKey = SAP-2026-11-12-001

### 1. Register one run BEFORE sending Opportunities
POST {{instance}}/services/data/v67.0/sobjects/Senvora_Import_Run__c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Run_Key__c": "{{runKey}}",
  "Status__c": "Ready"
}

### 2. After the integration has finished and verified results, signal completion
POST {{instance}}/services/apexrest/senvora/v1/import-complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runKey": "{{runKey}}"
}

### 3. Read the run status through SOQL REST query
GET {{instance}}/services/data/v67.0/query?q=SELECT+Run_Key__c,Status__c,Batch_Job_Id__c,Updated_Accounts__c,Failed_Accounts__c+FROM+Senvora_Import_Run__c+WHERE+Run_Key__c='{{runKey}}'
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
